# v1.0.64, opened by scripts/new_cut.sh from v1.0.63.
#
# WHY THESE PINS:
#   FOUR COLD-BOX DEFECTS plus the two gates that could never adjudicate. 
#   v1.0.63 was walked on a freshly wiped Mini 16 restored from Time Machine 
#   and failed 8 probes; 5 of 11 sources did not ingest. Root causes, each 
#   mutation-verified against 45126e9a before merge. #1418: (a) an empty 
#   owner email shipped into a LaunchAgent because osascript returns -600 
#   when Contacts.app has never been launched, so ai_conversations was 
#   permanently not_run AND the same rc=2 reddened health_check; (b) the 
#   source-status surface was written ONLY by install.sh, so every ongoing 
#   tick did real work and updated nothing -- all 11 sentinels frozen at 
#   install time while the iMessage extract was rewritten 38 minutes later 
#   with 136 people created; (c) RULE 2 of the dedupe ruleset was enforced on 
#   the resolve path and NOT on batch_resolver --converge, which install.sh 
#   runs on EVERY install, which is why the over-merge count GREW 128 to 130 
#   to 137 across boxes while the fix was believed in place; (d) 
#   identity_resolver declared 1 of its 3 dependencies. Plus #1415 the W003 
#   brew-log class (10 instances) and #1417 the iMessage declared-zero. 
#   GATES: install_manifest_complete refused to run remotely and every walk 
#   IS remote, so it had never adjudicated since v1.0.50; 
#   pair_state_agreement asked the doctor for a key only the gateway carries, 
#   and its glob parse would have reported PAIRED on a box with no phone once 
#   repointed. DAEMON PIN HELD at bc63c445 with the argument measured, not 
#   inherited: bc63c445 to main is ahead 1, behind 0, one file, .gitignore; 
#   files outside .gitignore = 0; CONTROL, the same predicate over bc63c445~5 
#   to bc63c445 returns 6, so the zero is real; Quality Gate at the pin reads 
#   declared 14 == enumerated 14, all success. CM051 pin is main head 
#   98398996, reachable from main and its install.sh blob 3a6c1a72 is 
#   byte-identical to main head.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

