# v1.0.65, opened by scripts/new_cut.sh from v1.0.64.
#
# WHY THESE PINS:
#   ONE DEFECT, AND IT IS THE ONE THAT MADE THE LAST WALK SAY FAILED. v1.0.63 
#   ended STEP_END id=health_check status=error rc=2 / DONE failed_steps=1 
#   while every probe inside that step logged healthy. Cause: USER_EMAIL 
#   comes from the macOS me-card via osascript, a Mac where Contacts has 
#   never been opened returns -600, so the address is empty and cm052.cli 
#   exits 2; the drain ran anyway and the rc was folded into the shared step 
#   recorder. Re-measured on the box against the installed binary: empty 
#   CM052_USER_EMAIL exits 2, CONTROL --help on the same binary exits 0, so 
#   the 2 is specific to the missing address and not a broken venv. v1.0.64 
#   FIXED ONLY THE OTHER HALF: it stopped registering an hourly agent that 
#   could only fail, but that guard sits BELOW the fold, so v1.0.64 still 
#   reddens health_check on any cold Mac. CM051 #1428 puts ONE predicate, 
#   _aiconv_owner_email_known, in front of BOTH consumers. The test is 
#   RUNTIME, not structural, because the defect is an ORDERING between a 
#   guard and a fold and both were present in the tree that shipped it: it 
#   extracts the real block and runs it against a stub producer exiting 2. 
#   TWO PINNED CONTROLS BOTH REPRODUCE THE FAILURE, 45126e9a (the v1.0.63 
#   cut) and deecd9fc (the fix's own parent, which is what proves v1.0.64 did 
#   not fix it), plus a negative control on the fix itself so deleting the 
#   fold is not the cheap way to green. WALK SUBJECT: the fresh archie 
#   account on the Mini, uid 502, created by Andy 2026-09-04. A brand-new 
#   account has never opened Contacts, which is exactly the condition this 
#   defect needs, so walking v1.0.64 there would have reproduced the red step 
#   on the only genuinely cold account available. DAEMON PIN HELD at 
#   bc63c445, argument RE-MEASURED not inherited: bc63c445 to main is ahead 1 
#   behind 0, one file, .gitignore; files outside .gitignore = 0; CONTROL, 
#   the same predicate over bc63c445~5 to bc63c445 returns 6, so the zero is 
#   real; Quality Gate at the pin reads declared 14 == enumerated 14, all 
#   success. CM051 pin 989545da is main head and reachable from main.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

